## Interface: 120100
## Title: SlashikChangingLayoutByText
## Notes: Switch Edit Mode layouts with /l <layout> or /layout <layout>. Use /l <seconds> (for example, /l 10) to say a random dungeon message and start a pull countdown. Use /l msg for a random dungeon message or /l rmsg for a random raid message, without a countdown. Type /l help to list available commands and layouts.
